  - m_Id: 53290602513
    m_Localized: Deal {value} damage to the opponent. +4 if placed in the 1st or
      5th slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1411976596847591549
  - m_Id: 53290602514
    m_Localized: Deal {value} damage to the opponent. Doubled if both adjacent cards
      are Attack cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1411976596847591549
  - m_Id: 53290602515
    m_Localized: Deal {value} damage to the opponent. Cast an additional time if
      the previous slot is Player-owned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1411976596847591549
  - m_Id: 53290602516
    m_Localized: Reduce incoming damage by {value}. Also cast the previous card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1411976596847591549
  - m_Id: 53290602517
    m_Localized: Reduce incoming damage by {value}. Draw 1 additional card next turn
      if the previous slot is Enemy-owned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1411976596847591549
  - m_Id: 53290602518
    m_Localized: Restore {value} HP. Cast 2 additional times if placed in the 2nd
      slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1411976596847591549
  - m_Id: 53290602519
    m_Localized: Gain {value} buff. +6 if you have 6 or fewer cards in hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1411976596847591549
  - m_Id: 53290602520
    m_Localized: Apply {value} debuff.
